  "tha-ap333:1.1": "Siddhatthassa bhagavato ",
  "tha-ap333:1.2": "gandhathūpam adās' ahaṃ / ",
  "tha-ap333:1.3": "sumanehi paṭicchannaṃ ",
  "tha-ap333:1.4": "Buddhānucchavikañ ca taṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap333:2.1": "Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāsaṃ ",
  "tha-ap333:2.2": "sambuddhaṃ lokanāyakaṃ / ",
  "tha-ap333:2.3": "indīvaraṃ va jalitam ",
  "tha-ap333:2.4": "ādittaṃ va hutāsanaṃ // // ",
  "tha-ap333:3.1": "Vyagghusabhaṃ va pa*varam ",
  "tha-ap333:3.2": "abhijātaṃ va* kesariṃ / ",
  "tha-ap333:3.3": "nisinnaṃ samaṇānaggaṃ ",
  "tha-ap333:3.4": "bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhataṃ // // ",
  "tha-ap333:4.1": "Disvā cittaṃ pasādetvā ",
  "tha-ap333:4.2": "paggahetvāna añjaliṃ / ",
  "tha-ap333:4.3": "vanditvā satthuno pāde ",
  "tha-ap333:4.4": "pakkāmiṃ uttarāmukho. // // ",
